$NetBSD: patch-ext_gtk_meson.build,v 1.1 2025/02/05 13:24:17 adam Exp $

Exit the Gtk subdirectory if Wayland option is disabled.

This is necessary to build the GStreamer libraries separately
from extension modules that do not define the full Wayland dependency set.

Rebased by EmberBSD (AI-assisted) for 1.28.8: the upstream use_wayland
check is gone; retain the package extension-build guard before dependencies.

--- ext/gtk/meson.build.orig
+++ ext/gtk/meson.build
@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+if get_option('wayland').disabled()
+  subdir_done()
+endif
+
 gtkwayland_sources = [
   'gstplugin.c',
   'gstgtkutils.c',
